    <main class="main-content" id="home">
      <header class="topbar"><div class="mobile-brand"><span class="brand-mark">s</span> Sakhi<span class="brand-light">Signal</span></div><div class="top-location"><span class="pin">⌖</span><span><small>YOUR AREA</small><b>Indiranagar, Bengaluru</b></span><span class="chevron">⌄</span></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Notifications">♧<i></i></button><button class="help-button">Need help? <span>↗</span></button></div></header>
      <header class="topbar"><div class="mobile-brand"><span class="brand-mark">r</span> Relay<span class="brand-light">Root</span></div><div class="top-location"><span class="pin">⌖</span><span><small>YOUR AREA</small><b>Indiranagar, Bengaluru</b></span><span class="chevron">⌄</span></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Notifications">♧<i></i></button><button class="help-button">Need help? <span>↗</span></button></div></header>
      <section class="welcome-row"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="sparkle">✳</span> YOUR SAFETY, IN YOUR HANDS</div><h1>Good evening, Ananya<span class="wave">✦</span></h1><p class="subtitle">A little more confidence for wherever you're headed.</p></div><div class="date-pill"><span>◷</span> Tuesday, October 14</div></section>

      <section class="hero-grid">
        <article class="journey-card" id="journey">
          <div class="journey-heading"><div><div class="card-eyebrow">PLAN YOUR JOURNEY</div><h2>Get there, feeling good.</h2></div><div class="route-symbol">↗</div></div>
          <div class="route-inputs"><label class="input-wrap"><span class="route-dot from-dot"></span><span class="input-label">FROM</span><input id="from" value="Indiranagar Metro Station" aria-label="Starting point"></label><div class="route-line"></div><label class="input-wrap"><span class="route-dot to-dot"></span><span class="input-label">TO</span><input id="to" placeholder="Where are you going?" aria-label="Destination"></label><button class="swap-button" id="swap" aria-label="Swap locations">⇅</button></div>
          <div class="journey-options"><button class="option-chip selected" data-mode="balanced"><span>✦</span> Balanced</button><button class="option-chip" data-mode="bright"><span>☼</span> Well-lit</button><button class="option-chip" data-mode="busy"><span>♧</span> Busier streets</button></div>
          <button class="primary-button" id="find-route">Find my safer route <span>→</span></button>
          <div class="route-result hidden" id="route-result"><div class="result-top"><span class="result-check">✓</span><div><b>Route ready</b><small id="route-description">A well-travelled option with active community signals.</small></div><span class="safe-badge">GOOD SIGNAL</span></div><div class="route-stats"><span>⌁ <b>2.4 km</b> <small>distance</small></span><span>◷ <b>11 min</b> <small>by auto</small></span><span>☼ <b>Well-lit</b> <small>most of the way</small></span></div></div>
          <div class="card-foot"><span>✳</span> Safety insights are community-informed, not guarantees.</div>
        </article>
        <article class="sos-card"><div class="sos-top"><div class="card-eyebrow">HERE WHEN YOU NEED US</div><div class="sos-orbit">✳</div></div><h2>A signal away.</h2><p>Alert your trusted circle and share your live location when you choose.</p><button class="sos-button" id="sos"><span class="sos-heart">♥</span> Send an SOS <span class="sos-arrow">→</span></button><div class="sos-foot"><span class="lock-icon">▣</span> Only shared with your trusted circle</div><div class="sos-decoration"></div></article>
      </section>

      <section class="resilience-section" id="resilience"><div class="resilience-heading"><div><div class="card-eyebrow">DESIGNED FOR THE MOMENTS AN APP CAN'T CONTROL</div><h2>Safety has more than one signal.</h2><p>Three backup layers for when your phone is locked, the app is paused, or the phone is gone.</p></div><span class="resilience-mark">✳</span></div><div class="resilience-grid">
        <article class="resilience-card"><div class="resilience-number">01</div><div class="resilience-icon lock-layer">⌑</div><div class="resilience-copy"><span class="layer-tag">LOCKED SCREEN</span><h3>Trigger without hunting for the app.</h3><p>Pair RelayRoot with a watch or discreet Bluetooth button. Also guide people to set up their phone’s built-in Emergency SOS before they need it.</p><button class="layer-link" data-layer="locked">Explore quick triggers <span>→</span></button></div></article>
        <article class="resilience-card"><div class="resilience-number">02</div><div class="resilience-icon background-layer">◷</div><div class="resilience-copy"><span class="layer-tag">BACKGROUND & BATTERY</span><h3>Make journey sharing an explicit session.</h3><p>Use platform-approved background location with a visible active-session indicator, adaptive updates, and a clear signal-health timestamp.</p><button class="layer-link" data-layer="background">See how it stays reliable <span>→</span></button></div></article>
        <article class="resilience-card"><div class="resilience-number">03</div><div class="resilience-icon backup-layer">⌁</div><div class="resilience-copy"><span class="layer-tag">PHONE TAKEN OR OFFLINE</span><h3>Keep a way to reach someone.</h3><p>A compatible cellular watch can contact help independently. A missed check-in can share only the last confirmed location, clearly marked with its time.</p><button class="layer-link" data-layer="backup">See the backup plan <span>→</span></button></div></article>
      </div><div class="resilience-note"><span>ⓘ</span><p><b>No app can guarantee a trigger, network, GPS fix, or emergency response.</b> RelayRoot shows when sharing is active, flags stale location, and offers other ways to get help.</p></div></section>

      <section class="relay-section" id="relay"><div class="relay-intro"><div><div class="card-eyebrow">THE DIFFERENCE: A FAILURE-AWARE SAFETY RELAY</div><h2>One plan. Multiple ways through.</h2><p>RelayRoot doesn’t assume your phone, app, or network will be available. Before a journey, it prepares a small, consent-limited Safety Capsule and checks which routes can carry it.</p></div><div class="relay-stamp"><span>✳</span><small>RELAY<br>PROTOCOL</small></div></div><div class="relay-demo"><div class="relay-demo-head"><div><span class="demo-live"></span><b>Journey readiness</b><small>Demo controls · nothing is actually sent</small></div><span class="capsule-tag">SAFETY CAPSULE <i>⌑</i></span></div><div class="readiness-grid"><div class="readiness-node active"><span class="node-icon">▣</span><span><b>Phone</b><small id="phone-status">Online · 78% battery</small></span><i>✓</i></div><div class="readiness-node active"><span class="node-icon watch-icon">◷</span><span><b>Watch / wearable</b><small id="wearable-status">Paired · independent SOS ready</small></span><i>✓</i></div><div class="readiness-node active"><span class="node-icon contact-icon">♡</span><span><b>Trusted contacts</b><small id="contact-status">2 available to acknowledge</small></span><i>✓</i></div><div class="readiness-node active"><span class="node-icon safe-icon">⌂</span><span><b>Nearby Safe Point</b><small id="safe-status">Partner venue · 350 m</small></span><i>✓</i></div></div><div class="capsule-preview"><div class="capsule-lock">⌑</div><div><b>What travels in the capsule?</b><p>Trigger source · last confirmed location + time · chosen contacts · expiry · response status</p></div><span class="encrypted-label">ENCRYPTED<br>MINIMUM DATA</span></div><div class="relay-actions"><span>Try a failure scenario:</span><button class="scenario-button" data-scenario="phone">Phone taken</button><button class="scenario-button" data-scenario="network">Data unavailable</button><button class="scenario-button reset-scenario" data-scenario="reset">Reset</button></div><div class="relay-result hidden" id="relay-result" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span class="relay-result-icon">↗</span><div><b id="relay-result-title">Relay route selected</b><p id="relay-result-copy"></p></div><span class="relay-demo-badge">SIMULATED</span></div></div><div class="relay-principle"><span>✳</span><p><b>AI’s job is to route, not to judge danger.</b> It checks channel health and selects the strongest pre-approved path. The recipient sees the location timestamp and can acknowledge; stale or undelivered signals stay clearly marked.</p></div></section>

      <section class="section-heading" id="signals"><div><div class="card-eyebrow">LOOKING OUT FOR EACH OTHER</div><h2>Community signals <span class="live-dot"></span></h2><p>Recent, nearby updates from people in your community.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="#all-signals">See all signals <span>→</span></a></section>
      <section class="signal-layout">
        <article class="map-card" aria-label="Illustrative area map"><div class="map-top"><span class="map-location"><span>⌖</span> Indiranagar, Bengaluru</span><button aria-label="Map layers">☷</button></div><div class="map-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 620 310" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true"><path class="road major" d="M-10 231 C100 195 171 213 251 183 S408 139 642 166"/><path class="road" d="M64 -20 C95 71 128 123 220 169 S330 243 344 325"/><path class="road" d="M208 -22 C207 45 261 78 303 121 S390 225 455 333"/><path class="road" d="M430 -20 C395 52 397 103 433 150 S502 229 545 330"/><path class="road" d="M-10 108 C113 127 190 116 271 91 S434 84 642 115"/><path class="road" d="M-10 280 C100 258 186 266 287 241 S462 221 641 250"/><path class="road thin" d="M130 -5 C153 67 180 108 221 139 M270 -5 C288 53 351 81 394 112 M370 186 C408 207 439 234 474 305 M16 166 C105 168 176 161 238 139 M303 195 C375 175 452 168 595 186"/></svg><span class="map-label label-1">100 Feet Rd</span><span class="map-label label-2">CMH Rd</span><span class="map-label label-3">Indiranagar</span><span class="map-pin user-pin"><i>●</i></span><span class="map-pin signal-pin one"><i>!</i></span><span class="map-pin signal-pin two"><i>✦</i></span><span class="map-pin signal-pin three"><i>!</i></span><div class="map-legend"><span><i class="legend-green"></i> Active area</span><span><i class="legend-pink"></i> Community signal</span></div></div></article>
        <article class="signals-card"><div class="signals-card-head"><div><b>Near you</b><small>Signals from the last 24 hours</small></div><button class="filter-button">Nearby⌄</button></div><div class="signal-item"><span class="signal-type lighting">☼</span><div class="signal-copy"><b>Street light out</b><p>12th Main Road, near the park</p><small>18 min ago <span>·</span> 2 people confirmed</small></div><span class="signal-chevron">›</span></div><div class="signal-item"><span class="signal-type crowd">♧</span><div class="signal-copy"><b>Busy, welcoming area</b><p>100 Feet Road, near Metro</p><small>42 min ago <span>·</span> 5 people confirmed</small></div><span class="signal-chevron">›</span></div><div class="signal-item"><span class="signal-type transit">↗</span><div class="signal-copy"><b>Auto stand active</b><p>Indiranagar Metro, Exit B</p><small>1 hr ago <span>·</span> 3 people confirmed</small></div><span class="signal-chevron">›</span></div><button class="report-button" id="report">＋ Share a community signal</button></article>
      </section>
      <section class="bottom-row" id="trusted"><article class="circle-card"><div class="circle-icon">♡</div><div><div class="card-eyebrow">YOUR PEOPLE, ON YOUR TERMS</div><h3>Your trusted circle</h3><p>3 people ready to hear from you</p></div><div class="circle-avatars"><span>A</span><span>M</span><span>R</span><button>+</button></div><a href="#circle" aria-label="Manage trusted circle">→</a></article><div class="tip-card"><span class="tip-icon">✳</span><div><b>A small check-in can mean a lot.</b><p>Share your journey with someone you trust whenever you'd like.</p></div><button id="checkin">Set a check-in <span>→</span></button></div></section>
